---
import AppShell from '../../components/AppShell.astro';
import { appVersion, contentVersion } from '../../lib/version';
import { site } from '../../site.config';
---

<AppShell
  title={`About & Guide | ${site.name}`}
  description="How to find songs, plan a set, present, and use Stuti Songs offline."
>
  <article class="prose guide">
    <h1 class="page-title">About & Guide</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>{site.name}</strong> is a free Christian hymnal for Indian churches. It works offline, numbers
      songs like your printed book, and needs no sign-in.
    </p>

    <nav class="guide-toc" aria-label="Topics">
      <a class="chip" href="#find">Find a song</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#number">By number</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#set">Plan a set</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#share">Share</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#present">Present</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#offline">Offline</a>
      <a class="chip" href="#settings">Settings</a>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="find">Find a song</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open the <strong>Search</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>हिन्दी</strong> or <strong>English</strong>.</li>
      <li>Tap the first letter of the song.</li>
      <li>Tap the song. Use <strong>Book</strong> and <strong>Topic</strong> to narrow.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="number">Find by hymn number</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Home</strong> → <strong>Hymnbooks</strong> → tap your book.</li>
      <li>The list is in number order. Use the jump bar (1 · 50 · 100…).</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="set">Plan a set</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Sets</strong> → New set → pick a service → Create.</li>
      <li>Type hymn numbers (e.g. 12, 46) or browse with the library button.</li>
      <li>Tap a song to set key and verses. Then Start singing.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="share">Share a set</h2>
    <p>
      In the set, tap Share for WhatsApp, Copy link, QR, Calendar, Order of service, or PowerPoint.
    </p>

    <h2 id="present">Show on a projector</h2>
    <p>
      Tap Present. Keys: → next, ← back, B black screen, Esc exit.
    </p>

    <h2 id="offline">Use without internet</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Offline</strong> tab → download next to a book → wait for the check mark.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 id="settings">Settings</h2>
    <p>
      Tap the gear: Theme (System / Light / Dark), text size, church book, church name. Theme is remembered on
      every page without refreshing.
    </p>

    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No internet?</strong> Download books on Offline first.</li>
      <li><strong>Wrong words?</strong> On a song → ⋯ → Report a mistake.</li>
      <li><strong>Is it free?</strong> Yes. No ads, no tracking.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="muted">
      Version {appVersion} · data {contentVersion} · <a href="/about/">Privacy &amp; contact</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</AppShell>

<style>
  .guide-toc {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .guide h2 {
    scroll-margin-top: 72px;
  }
</style>
